1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,700
Tu as une mauvaise mine. Ça ne va pas ?
You look unwell. Are you OK?

2
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:23,468
Je ne me sens pas bien depuis deux jours. J'ai un rhume et je tousse beaucoup.
I haven't felt well for two days. I have a cold and I'm coughing a lot.

3
00:00:23,568 --> 00:00:26,180
Tu as de la fièvre ?
Do you have a fever?

4
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:31,772
Un peu. Et j'ai du mal à dormir à cause de la toux.
A little. And I have trouble sleeping because of the cough.

5
00:00:31,872 --> 00:00:37,172
Tu as besoin de repos. Tu devrais voir un médecin.
You need rest. You should see a doctor.

6
00:00:37,272 --> 00:00:42,956
Tu as raison. Je vais prendre rendez-vous demain matin.
You're right. I'll make an appointment tomorrow morning.
